{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":12378198,"name":"UltrawGames","username":"Ultraw","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/devforum.roblox.com/ultraw/{size}/8832790_2.png","created_at":"2025-05-03T06:52:46.684Z","cooked":"\u003ch2\u003e\u003ca name=\"p-12378198-chef-luigi-is-back-to-bring-you-a-brand-new-restaurant-tycoon-game-and-its-better-than-ever-here-are-50-brand-new-features-to-explore-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-12378198-chef-luigi-is-back-to-bring-you-a-brand-new-restaurant-tycoon-game-and-its-better-than-ever-here-are-50-brand-new-features-to-explore-1\"\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eChef Luigi is back to bring you a brand new Restaurant Tycoon game - and it’s better than ever. Here are 50+ brand new features to explore:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew dishes:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/globe_showing_europe_africa.png?v=14\" title=\":globe_showing_europe_africa:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":globe_showing_europe_africa:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e The world is waiting with over 200 dishes to serve. Choose from over 50 cuisines for your restaurant!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e3rd floor:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/office_building.png?v=14\" title=\":office_building:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":office_building:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Reach new heights with a third floor for your establishment.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWall placement:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/brick.png?v=14\" title=\":brick:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":brick:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Get creative with precise control over your restaurant’s layout with custom wall placement and diagonal wall placement.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDoor placement:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/door.png?v=14\" title=\":door:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":door:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Come one, come all—from anywhere! Achieve more customization by placing doors anywhere along your walls.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWindow placement:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/framed_picture.png?v=14\" title=\":framed_picture:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":framed_picture:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Let there be light! Customize your restaurant’s ambiance with flexible window placement options.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSentiments / emotions:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes.png?v=14\" title=\":grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":grinning_face_with_smiling_eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Customers show emojis showing how they are feeling\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew world map menu:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/world_map.png?v=14\" title=\":world_map:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":world_map:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Explore the origins of your ingredients and dishes with an interactive 3D globe.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMilestones menu:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/flexed_biceps.png?v=14\" title=\":flexed_biceps:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":flexed_biceps:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Track skill progression in areas like chopping speed.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMap buildings:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/carrot.png?v=14\" title=\":carrot:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":carrot:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Upgrade your dishes and acquire ingredients at specialized locations around the map.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew UI:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/sparkles.png?v=14\" title=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sparkles:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Managing your restaurant is easier (and prettier!) than ever with our complete UI overhaul.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNew starter restaurants:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/houses.png?v=14\" title=\":houses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":houses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Select from community-designed starter restaurants to kickstart your journey.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eObjectives:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/scroll.png?v=14\" title=\":scroll:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":scroll:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Embark on quests displayed on-screen to unlock new dishes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWallpaper:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/artist_palette.png?v=14\" title=\":artist_palette:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":artist_palette:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Paint your walls with an abundance of wallpapers!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore Roofs:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/house.png?v=14\" title=\":house:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":house:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Rise to architectural fame by customizing roof shapes! Fine-tune your building’s aesthetic with adjustable roof height and overhang.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFarming\u003c/strong\u003e - \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/man_farmer.png?v=14\" title=\":man_farmer:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":man_farmer:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Start your own farm to grow organic ingredients like carrots, potatoes and onions!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore kitchen items / kitchen tiers:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/cooking.png?v=14\" title=\":cooking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cooking:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Expand your culinary capabilities with new kitchen equipment and upgrade tiers, including sinks.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCan cancel operations:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/right_arrow_curving_left.png?v=14\" title=\":right_arrow_curving_left:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":right_arrow_curving_left:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Cancel ongoing actions, like delivering food.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrecision build (gamepass):\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/triangular_ruler.png?v=14\" title=\":triangular_ruler:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":triangular_ruler:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Utilize advanced tools for precise item rotation and placement.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSandbox mode (gamepass):\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/hourglass_done.png?v=14\" title=\":hourglass_done:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":hourglass_done:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003eUnleash your creativity with sandbox mode—unlimited furniture items for free!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFurniture better rotation:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/counterclockwise_arrows_button.png?v=14\" title=\":counterclockwise_arrows_button:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":counterclockwise_arrows_button:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Choose from more granular rotation options to find that perfect angle for your furniture.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSign improvements:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/writing_hand.png?v=14\" title=\":writing_hand:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":writing_hand:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Give your restaurant’s signage character with custom fonts and colors.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTertiary colors:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/rainbow.png?v=14\" title=\":rainbow:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":rainbow:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Get artsy with items supporting up to three colors and materials.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFires / burned food:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/fire.png?v=14\" title=\":fire:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":fire:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Put your cooking skills to the test against the dangers of unattended flames… I mean food!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlot selection:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/world_map.png?v=14\" title=\":world_map:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":world_map:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Choose the location of your plot on the map in a few clicks!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrophies:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/trophy.png?v=14\" title=\":trophy:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":trophy:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Earn recognition for your milestones by unlocking in-game trophies.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWorker upgrades:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/cook.png?v=14\" title=\":cook:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cook:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Improve staff efficiency through upgradable skills and abilities.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomer spawn points:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/man_walking.png?v=14\" title=\":man_walking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":man_walking:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003eOptimize customer flow by strategically placing multiple spawn points.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBetter multiplayer permissions:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/handshake.png?v=14\" title=\":handshake:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":handshake:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Get collaborative with expanded management capabilities for multiplayer restaurants, as long as you set players as a “co-owner”.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSend gifts to other restaurants:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/wrapped_gift.png?v=14\" title=\":wrapped_gift:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wrapped_gift:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Uplift your community by sharing likes or temporary boosts with other players.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEating animations:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/hamburger.png?v=14\" title=\":hamburger:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":hamburger:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Immerse yourself in the dining experience with realistic customer eating animations. Customers now eat burgers with their hands!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFree grid size changes:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/triangular_ruler.png?v=14\" title=\":triangular_ruler:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":triangular_ruler:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Customize your building precision by setting the grid size to either 2 or 1, completely free of charge.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBigger plots:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/star_struck.png?v=14\" title=\":star_struck:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":star_struck:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e The largest plot size is now 128x128, larger than ever before\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBetter cooking animations:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/sparkles.png?v=14\" title=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sparkles:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Enjoy enhanced visual and auditory feedback during the cooking process.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSave file improvements:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/floppy_disk.png?v=14\" title=\":floppy_disk:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":floppy_disk:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Save files now say when they were last used.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBetter NPCs animations:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/eyes.png?v=14\" title=\":eyes:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":eyes:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Workers emote and gesticulate, while customers gaze and will rotate their heads and animate more realistically.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustom color RGB and hex input:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/artist_palette.png?v=14\" title=\":artist_palette:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":artist_palette:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Satisfy the perfectionist in you with precise RGB and hex code colour input.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrimitive blocks:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/brick.png?v=14\" title=\":brick:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":brick:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Expand your building toolkit with basic geometric shapes for custom constructions.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Improvements:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/wood.png?v=14\" title=\":wood:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wood:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Change the look of any item with an extended material catalogue!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore custom food:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/sushi.png?v=14\" title=\":sushi:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sushi:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Offer personalized culinary creations with customizable sushi, sandwiches, and salads.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlot digging:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/ocean.png?v=14\" title=\":ocean:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":ocean:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Excavate plots and introduce water and open space to bring the great outdoors into your canvas!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart render system:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/dashing_away.png?v=14\" title=\":dashing_away:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":dashing_away:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Enhance performance with an intelligent system that optimizes the rendering of distant player restaurants.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWorker Customization:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/glasses.png?v=14\" title=\":glasses:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":glasses:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Personalize your staff’s appearance with more diverse customization options, including more hat/hair/face options and better control over accessories e.g. beards, glasses.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore save files:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/tada.png?v=14\" title=\":tada:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":tada:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Manage multiple restaurant ventures with an increased limit of 15 free save files.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFood critics:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/writing_hand.png?v=14\" title=\":writing_hand:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":writing_hand:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Visiting food critics rate your restaurant and award $200 for a great review!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEncounter tracking:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/man_detective.png?v=14\" title=\":man_detective:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":man_detective:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Track the number of interactions with unique special customers.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecial customer abilities:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/sparkles.png?v=14\" title=\":sparkles:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":sparkles:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Leverage the unique benefits offered by special customers, viewable in your manager desk menu.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSelect expansion type:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/seedling.png?v=14\" title=\":seedling:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":seedling:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Tailor the aesthetic of your restaurant’s expansions to your preferences.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustom Height Walls:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/straight_ruler.png?v=14\" title=\":straight_ruler:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":straight_ruler:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Customize new special walls’ heights.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWorker Roles:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/cook.png?v=14\" title=\":cook:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":cook:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Optimize your service by assigning specific tasks to your waiting staff, including greeting customers, taking orders, etc.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWaiter carts:\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/shopping_cart.png?v=14\" title=\":shopping_cart:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":shopping_cart:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e Upgrade service efficiency by enabling waiters to carry up to 4 dishes simultaneously.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRush Hour\u003c/strong\u003e \u003cimg src=\"https://doy2mn9upadnk.cloudfront.net/images/emoji/twitter/money_mouth_face.png?v=14\" title=\":money_mouth_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":money_mouth_face:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003eDaily events which last one hour, giving perks and boosts to everyone who is in the game!\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":1,"updated_at":"2026-02-25T12:43:34.888Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":175082,"reads":5950,"readers_count":5949,"score":884984.4,"yours":false,"topic_id":3636102,"topic_slug":"50-new-features-in-restaurant-tycoon-3%E2%AD%90","display_username":"UltrawGames","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":7,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"https://devforum.roblox.com/t/creator-spotlight-how-ultraw%E2%80%99s-love-for-food-became-a-trending-tycoon/3840933","internal":true,"reflection":true,"title":"Creator Spotlight: How Ultraw’s Love for Food Became a Trending Tycoon","clicks":511}],"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[{"id":2,"count":620}],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":9565,"hidden":false,"trust_level":1,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/50-new-features-in-restaurant-tycoon-3%E2%AD%90/3636102/1","can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":false,"can_translate":false,"is_translated":false,"detected_language":"English (US)"}],"stream":[12378198]},"timeline_lookup":[[1,544]],"suggested_topics":[],"tags":[],"tags_descriptions":{},"id":3636102,"title":"50 New Features in Restaurant Tycoon 3⭐","fancy_title":"50 New Features in Restaurant Tycoon 3⭐","posts_count":1,"created_at":"2025-05-03T06:52:46.410Z","views":180624,"reply_count":0,"like_count":620,"last_posted_at":"2025-05-03T06:52:46.684Z","visible":true,"closed":false,"archived":false,"has_summary":false,"archetype":"regular","slug":"50-new-features-i